        <mxCell id="c69" value="&lt;b&gt;Read against Chapter 8&#x27;s ranges&lt;/b&gt;: close up to 0.006, acceptable up to 0.012, marginally acceptable up to 0.015, nonconformity above. All payments, 0.01295, are marginally acceptable; full payments, 0.00755, acceptable; partial payments, 0.04496, a nonconformity. The slicer is set to None for the table, so choosing Partial leaves the three rows." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="266" width="464" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
